{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Fighting the Competition", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Asking for an Extension", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 11, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 9, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use important information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Language for Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Remember that in the business world, it is common to give your opinion about things.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Review some of the ways in which you can ask and give opinions:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Giving Opinions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I believe ...<br/> I reckon ...<br/> As far as I know, ...<br/> If you ask me, ...<br/> Personally, ...<br/> To my mind, ...<br/> The way I see it, ...<br/> To be honest / frank ...<br/> I am confident that ...<br/>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">I am confident that</span> your reputation offers a competitive edge.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">As you know,</span> we need to carry out some market research.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Personally,</span> I look forward to showing you our results.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Future Actions, Plans, and Intentions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Remember when we know about the future, the <span class=\"strong\">Present</span> tense is used:<br/> <ul><li>The <span class=\"italic\">Present Simple</span> is used for things that are <span class=\"italic\">arranged</span> and <span class=\"italic\">scheduled</span>.</li> <li>The <span class=\"italic\">Present Continuous</span> is used for <span class=\"italic\">plans</span> or <span class=\"italic\">arrangements</span>.</li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When we don't know much about the future, <span class=\"strong\">will</span> is used: <ul><li>to make predictions</li> <li>for voluntary actions, actions you \u201cwant\u201d or \u201care willing\u201d to do</li> <li>to make offers and promises</li> </ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>\u201c(be) going to\u201d is used to talk about plans and intentions:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I'm going to draw up something they can't refuse.</span></li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "It is important to remember that both \u201cwill\u201d and \u201cbe going to\u201d refer to a specific time in the future. The chart below summarizes the two structures.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Be going to</span>  [subject + be going to + verb]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Will</span> [subject + will + verb]\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>to express a plan</li> <li>to express a prediction</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>to express a promise</li> <li>to express a voluntary action</li> <li>to express a prediction</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I <span class=\"strong\">will reschedule</span> our meeting for next week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We <span class=\"strong\">are going to obtain</span> the same results.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " It <span class=\"strong\">will be</span> a great opportunity for us.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "This <span class=\"strong\">will give</span> us enough time to finish the project.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "partnership", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the state of working closely with another company", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We are very excited with this partnership, Mr. Farmani.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are the words to review.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "extensive", "type": "name"}, {"content": "large in amount", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: This requires extensive research.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "personalized", "type": "name"}, {"content": "refers to something that is designed or changed so that it is suitable for a particular company", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your agency has a reputation for the personalized services it provides.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "advantageous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "creating favorable conditions that increase the chances of success", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It will be greatly advantageous if we can have until the end of the week.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "a competitive edge", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an advantage that a company has over its competitors", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I know the competitive edge that your agency offers.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to reschedule", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to change the time of a planned event", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I will reschedule the meeting.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn6le09ob11aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Think of what you want your life in be like in 10 years.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What kind of job do you think you will have?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "What kind of work experience will you have?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down 10 sentences about your future. Use \u201cwill\u201d and \u201cbe going to\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your sentences with a partner. Ask your partner for their opinion on your future.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to your partner's sentences. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give your opinion about their future plans.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about a job I want to have.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write about my future plans and intentions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give my opinion about my partner's future plans.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Janet! A pleasure to meet you in person. How do you do?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Very well, thank you,  Mr. Farmani. The pleasure is mine.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Please have a seat, Janet. I am looking forward to discussing your proposal.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Thank you. We are very excited with this partnership, Mr. Farmani. The way I see it, expanding into a new cultural market requires extensive research. We are going to obtain the same success in Latin America as we are used to achieving elsewhere."}, {"image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img06.jpg", "time": "32000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Your agency has a reputation for its personalized service.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: True. The potential here is too great to lose through carelessness. While we will proceed immediately, we need to be thorough in our research. I would like to ask you for an extension on the proposal deadline.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: How much of an extension do you need?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: I believe it'll be greatly advantageous if we can have until the end of this week. I reckon this is going to give us what we need to draw up a proposal you can't refuse."}, {"image": "engenn6le09ob11re2img07.jpg", "time": "65000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: A four-day extension then. I am confident in your reputation and know your competitive edge. Personally, I don't believe you would ask for an extension without excellent reason. I will reschedule a meeting for Friday.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: Thank you. I look forward to presenting you with the excellent results on Friday. Have a good day.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Good day to you too."}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le09ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le09ob11re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "x", "type": "audio"}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Out